##  Overview

This document details a full exploit chain that starts with a hardcoded API key in the APK and leads to:

- Full read/write/delete on the entire R2 cloud storage (all manga chapters).
- Cloudflare zone management (DNS, Workers, WAF).
- Firebase account creation and password‑reset bombing.
- Potential Remote Code Execution (RCE) via file upload.

All credentials are exposed through an unauthenticated endpoint.

---

##  Requirements

- curl (with --aws-sigv4 support – available in modern versions)
- jq for JSON parsing
- python3 + requests (for automation)
- awscli (optional, for S3‑style bulk operations)

