# BLAST RADIUS & Remediation

- Critical – all credentials must be rotated immediately.
- Disable public access to /settings or remove secrets from its response.
- Use short‑lived, scoped tokens (pre‑signed URLs) for R2.
- Enable Firebase App Check to prevent anonymous account creation.
- Implement server‑side file validation for uploads.
- Add certificate pinning and disable cleartext traffic.

